Biodiversity Hotspot Monitoring Dashboard
Copyright (c) 2026 Sumit Singh, Lbhagirathi, Adhin, Aritra.

This project implements a reproducible pipeline for monitoring biodiversity
patterns using species occurrence data and spatial analysis.

